      <div class="border-t border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
        <p>© <span id="current-year">2026</span> Pascal Riester. All rights reserved.</p>
